{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=law,swat|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,5",{"Head shot, then I move on, that's about all I got"}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=law,swat|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,5|world=vehicle",{"Stayed in the cruiser, stayed on the radio, not so much anymore"}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=civilian|st=friendly,neutral|world=building",{"Luck, mostly, and a basement with a lock, I don't feel very brave"}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=family|st=friendly,neutral",{"We stayed together - that's all, nobody was ever left behind"}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=worker|st=friendly,neutral",{"Barricaded the plant's loading dock with pallets and ate vending machine candy for a week","Climbed up the grain elevator with a thermos of coffee and a bag of pork rinds - stayed four days, ran out of rinds on two"}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"We kept moving and kept helping, kept our heads down"}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=law|st=friendly,neutral",{"I stuck to procedure, sounds silly, but when everything else falls apart, procedure is something"}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=swat|st=friendly,neutral",{"Training, we did the drills until they were habit"}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=military|st=friendly,neutral",{"Discipline and cover, that's the answer"}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=elite|st=friendly,neutral",{"I stayed quiet","Planning, then violence of action"}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=outlaw|st=friendly,neutral",{"I've always been good at not being where the trouble is"}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=raider|st=friendly,neutral",{"I'm meaner than they are - Hah"}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=gang|st=friendly,neutral",{"Stayed with my crew, nobody in this world survives alone"}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=club|st=friendly,neutral",{"Kept the bikes running and the brothers close"}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=crime|st=friendly,neutral",{"Planning, I always plan three steps ahead"}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=prison|st=friendly,neutral",{"Same way I survived lockup - keep your head down and don't trust anyone","Prison teaches you to sleep with one eye open, turns out that's about all it takes now"}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"I hid! Closet, car, under a bed... a bathtub with the shower curtain over me, I just hid and shook","I ran -- that's it, I just ran, until my lungs burned, then I ran some more","Luck! pure, dumb luck, right place, wrong time, no wait, wrong place, right time, I don't know","My neighbor pulled me into his house, and he's- he's not here anymore, but I am, because of him","I don't know! I keep asking myself, why me? why am I the one still breathing?","I locked myself in the pantry with a loaf of bread and a prayer","Did what my dad always told me, stayed calm and kept moving","Honestly? I got lucky, and I got scared, and being scared kept me alive"}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"I learned to be quiet, quieter than I ever thought a person could be","Kept moving, mostly... never trusted a quiet room after the first week","Stayed with people, even when they were a pain, a group can watch each other's backs","Woods... I know the woods, I knew where they don't wander, so I went there","Stubbornness... mostly, my mother always said I was too ornery to die","I watched, I listened, I made mistakes, and I learned from the ones that didn't kill me","Every day I tell myself, one more day, just one more, and so far it's worked"}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"How I did it's my own damn business","I survived, and I'd like to keep surviving without telling a stranger my secrets","How I survived is not for sale","That's my business","How I survived isn't your concern","I did what I had to","Carefully","By NOT talking to strangers","By minding my own affairs!!","By not answering questions from strangers - keep your distance"}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","role=rescue_medical|st=friendly,neutral",{"Washing my hands a hundred times a day, mostly... and not looking too close at the bad days","Training, adrenaline, and a lot of caffeine, now only the adrenaline remains","I kept moving... kept washing, kept my head clear, and kept my patients alive, and they kept me alive","I've seen a lot of death, it makes you strange, it makes you strong, it makes you tired","By treating every day like a double shift, and every night like a hangover"}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","role=rescue_clergy|st=friendly,neutral",{"By the grace of God, and a lot of folks' kindness, and a pot of soup that never seemed to empty","By faith, and by bread","I prayed, and then I put my shoulder to the door","The Lord's mercy, and my congregation's"},false,false,{[2]={{t="mostly by bread",afterMs=3500}},[3]={{t="both were necessary",afterMs=3200}},[4]={{t="I was carried",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","role=rescue_firefighter|st=friendly,neutral",{"Training kicked in, and my crew kept me on my feet, and somebody pulled me out of the smoke","Training...","My crew carried me out of a basement"},false,false,{[2]={{t="muscle memory",afterMs=3500},{t="the body knows what to do",afterMs=3000}},[3]={{t="I owe them everything",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","role=militia|st=friendly,neutral",{"Kept low, kept quiet, kept my rifle clean, and made it through each day like it was the last","Discipline","Luck, mostly"},false,false,{[2]={{t="sleep, eat, check your gear, repeat",afterMs=3500}},[3]={{t="and a lot of cover",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","role=civilian_loner|st=friendly,neutral",{"Same as always... lived off the land, kept to myself, and didn't open my door for anybody","Stayed out of the way","I live like I always did","Quiet and patience","I read the woods"},false,false,{[2]={{t="that's all I've ever done",afterMs=3500}},[3]={{t="the dead just joined the list of things to avoid",afterMs=3200}},[4]={{t="that's the secret, and I'm not even sure it is one",afterMs=3500}},[5]={{t="it told me when to move",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","role=rescue_medical|st=careful",{"Skill, luck, and not telling strangers how"}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=sad",{"I wasn't brave, I just wasn't first","My son pushed me through the window... and stayed","I survived because my husband didn't","A woman I'd never met pulled me into her house"},false,false,{[1]={{t="someone else was closer to the door, and I've never forgiven myself for it",afterMs=3500}},[2]={{t="that's how I survived",afterMs=3500},{t="please don't ask me anything else",afterMs=3200}},[3]={{t="it's an unfair trade, and nobody asked me",afterMs=3500}},[4]={{t="she's gone now, but I'm here",afterMs=3500},{t="I owe her my life",afterMs=3000}}}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=funny",{"Hid in the freezer at the diner, with the pies","I fell off a roof, onto a trampoline, onto a hedge!","By being too skinny to eat, apparently","I out-ran a man in a wheelchair, I'm not proud","I'm too stubborn to die","I out-ran a guy who was faster than me!"},false,false,{[1]={{t="came out alive, and fat",afterMs=3200}},[2]={{t="I've never been so lucky in my life",afterMs=3200}},[3]={{t="my wife says it's the only compliment she's ever given me",afterMs=3200}},[5]={{t="my wife says it's my best quality",afterMs=3200},{t="and my worst",afterMs=3000}},[6]={{t="he tripped",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=warm",{"Strangers, mostly, folks kinder than I had any right to expect","My neighbors and I kept each other going, we sang hymns at night"},false,false,{[1]={{t="a family took me in, fed me, never asked for a dime",afterMs=3200}},[2]={{t="that's how I survived, by singing",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=grim",{"You don't survive -- you postpone...","I did what I had to, and I don't talk about what that was","I was the last in line... and the first to run"},false,false,{[1]={{t="I'm good at postponing",afterMs=3200}},[3]={{t="I'm not proud of that, but I'm alive",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|mood=fear",{"I don't know- I don't know how I'm alive","I just kept running!","I stood still, completely still, for three hours, in a corner!"},false,false,{[1]={{t="I keep waiting for it to stop making sense",afterMs=3500}},[2]={{t="they were behind me, I felt them- then they were gone",afterMs=3500},{t="I don't know why they stopped",afterMs=3000}},[3]={{t="it looked right through me",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral|mood=calm",{"Lots of canned beans and a lot of sitting still","I dug in, kept quiet, and let the storm pass","Same thing every day - up, eat, check the locks, bed"},false,false,{[2]={{t="it's still passing",afterMs=3500}},[3]={{t="routine saved my mind",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"I hid in a pantry for three days","A man pulled me out of a car","I climbed a tree","I played dead","I followed the sound of singing","I locked myself in a bathroom","I swam across a creek","I ran","Somebody threw me a rope","I ate what I could find","I stayed with my family"},false,false,{[1]={{t="I ate dry cereal",afterMs=3500},{t="I haven't eaten dry cereal since",afterMs=3000}},[2]={{t="I never learned his name",afterMs=3500},{t="I hope he made it",afterMs=3000}},[3]={{t="I stayed there all night",afterMs=3200},{t="I didn't know I could climb",afterMs=2800}},[4]={{t="it worked",afterMs=3500},{t="I don't want to talk about how",afterMs=3000}},[5]={{t="there was a church, with a locked door and a kind old preacher",afterMs=3200}},[6]={{t="with a bat, and a prayer",afterMs=3500},{t="the prayer worked better",afterMs=3000}},[7]={{t="in my clothes",afterMs=3200},{t="and I can't swim",afterMs=2800}},[8]={{t="and I kept running",afterMs=3500},{t="I think I'm still running",afterMs=3000}},[9]={{t="from a barn loft",afterMs=3200},{t="I'll never forget that rope",afterMs=2800}},[10]={{t="and slept where I could hide",afterMs=3500},{t="and I told myself, one more hour",afterMs=3000}},[11]={{t="that's the secret",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"Together, honestly, we survived together"},false,false,{[1]={{t="and you can do the same",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","role=civilian_loner|st=careful",{"My business!","By not answering questions like that one"}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","role=family_elder|st=friendly,neutral",{"Stubbornness, dear","By not leaving the house","Faith and bread","I'm old, old people stay home - first time in my life that ever paid off"},false,false,{[1]={{t="I'm too stubborn to die",afterMs=3500},{t="my husband said so",afterMs=3000}},[2]={{t="I've outlasted worse, like my husband's mother",afterMs=3200}},[3]={{t="mostly bread",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","role=family_youth|st=friendly,neutral",{"My dog warned me","I hid in the attic","I just kind of ran"},false,false,{[1]={{t="he barked like crazy",afterMs=3500},{t="and I listened, for once",afterMs=3000}},[2]={{t="with a bag of pretzels and a baseball bat",afterMs=3200}},[3]={{t="and kept running",afterMs=3500},{t="my gym teacher would be proud",afterMs=3000}}}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","role=family_youth|st=careful",{"That's none of your business, {mister}, I'm not telling a stranger"}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","role=worker|st=friendly,neutral",{"I climbed a rack of shelving","Welded the door shut from inside","I did what I always did"},false,false,{[1]={{t="and stayed there till dawn",afterMs=3500},{t="best sleep of my life",afterMs=3000}},[2]={{t="old habit",afterMs=3200}},[3]={{t="showed up, kept my head down, and did the job",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","role=worker|st=careful",{"Skill and luck"}},
