{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","role=rescue_clergy|st=careful",{"By grace"}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","role=militia|st=careful",{"Keep it quiet"}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"I took what I needed and didn't ask nicely, that's how","Luck, mostly, and a willingness to do what other people won't","By being meaner and faster than whatever came for me","I'm still here because I haven't let anyone get close enough to stop me","Stayed away from crowds and kept my gun loaded, simple as that"}},
