{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=raider|st=friendly",{"Honestly? Lots of luck and a really good hiding spot, I can't believe I made it"}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","role=raider_boss,gang_boss,biker_boss|st=neutral,careful",{"By making sure others did the surviving for me"}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Stuck with my crew and never fell asleep alone","We watched each other's backs, everybody else was on their own","Ran when I had to, fought when I couldn't run"}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=gang|st=hostile",{"Same way I'll survive you, easily"}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=gang|st=friendly",{"Man, I don't even know, I'm still shaking sometimes"}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"The brothers had my back, I had theirs, and that's how it went","Kept moving, never stayed where the dead could find me"}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=club|st=hostile",{"By not letting people like you walk up behind me"}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=club|st=friendly",{"God's honest truth, a lot of whiskey and a lot of prayer"}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"By planning ahead, it's a lost art","Cash, and a few guys who owed me favors, they still do"}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=crime|st=friendly",{"Honestly? I got lucky, very lucky"}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"Stayed quiet, stayed small, stayed hidden, same as I did inside","Didn't trust anyone, that's what kept me alive in there too"}},
