{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=prison|st=friendly",{"I don't know, I really don't, every night I wonder why I'm still here"}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful",{"Knew the woods, knew the quiet places, stayed out of the way","By not being where the noise was"}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=outlaw|st=friendly",{"Same way as you, one bad day at a time"}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","role=deserter|st=neutral,careful",{"I ran, and I kept running, that's all"}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"Training, and a lot of luck","Stayed with my partner, covered each other, he's gone now","By holding the line and not panicking, mostly"}},
