{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=military|st=hostile",{"Because I'm armed and you're not, that's how"}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=military|st=friendly",{"By the grace of God, I can't take credit"}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","role=soldier_green|st=neutral,careful",{"I don't know, I really don't, I keep thinking I should be dead already"}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","role=mercenary|st=neutral,careful",{"By expecting the worst, always"}},
