{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","role=militia|st=friendly",{"Hard work, good friends, and a whole lot of prayer"}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|world=building",{"Honestly? I hid in the church basement in {town} for three days eating communion wafers - I'm not proud - I'm alive"}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"My neighbor Earl pulled me up into his truck, he didn't stop for his own dog, I think about that a lot","I don't know, the people on both sides of me didn't - I kept running, and one day I stopped, and I was still here"}},
