{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=civilian,family|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Quiet, slow, and never at night - three rules, the folks who broke 'em are the ones who taught me the rules"}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=civilian,family|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral|world=cars,water,road",{"Quit trusting cars, everybody who drove for the highway ended up in the jam past Muldraugh - I walked the creek beds"}},
