{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=law,swat|st=careful,hostile",{"Same way you'll survive the next minute - by listening - hands where I can see them"}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=military|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"I stayed behind the sergeant, he said run, I ran, he said shoot, I shot - that's all I did"}},
