{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=outlaw,crime|st=friendly,neutral",{"Been living off the grid in a camper past Fallas Lake six years - the world ending was more of an inconvenience"}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=outlaw,crime|st=friendly,neutral|world=road",{"I know every back road and holler in this county from running loads at night - them things don't"}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=raider,gang,club|st=friendly,neutral",{"Easy, when one comes, I make sure somebody slower is standing next to me"}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=careful",{"Why, you writing a book? I got this far by not trusting nosy folks"}},
{"ASK_HOW_SURVIVED","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=hostile",{"By taking what I needed off people like you - wanna see how it's done?"},false,{[1]="GENERIC"}},
