{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=family_man,family_woman,family_youth|tmp=fresh,seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Managed a dry cleaner on Main Street, mostly I kept the kids' school forms in order","I was home with the little ones, doesn't sound like much until you try it in a crisis"}},
