{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=rescue_firefighter|tmp=seasoned|st=careful",{"Fire department, yes, I'm still allowed to say it"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=rescue_medical|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"I'm a nurse, night shift at the county hospital - I learned to function on coffee and fear","Family doctor, colds and blood pressure, this is a different practice"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=rescue_medical|tmp=seasoned|st=careful",{"I was a medic, that's all I'll say right now"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=rescue_clergy|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"I'm a pastor, eighteen years in the pulpit, nobody ever told me what to say for this","Church secretary, then deacon, then whatever the congregation needed me to be"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=rescue_clergy|tmp=seasoned|st=careful",{"I was a minister, I'd like to be left alone to pray"}},
