{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=law_deputy,law_officer|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral|world=fence",{"County police, mostly drunk drivers and fence disputes - I'd take either one over this"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=law_deputy,law_officer|tmp=seasoned|st=careful",{"Law enforcement, I'm asking the questions here, {sir}"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=law_sheriff,law_sergeant|tmp=veteran|st=friendly,neutral",{"Twenty-two years with the department, I've arrested half of this county and been to the funerals of the other half","Sergeant on the night shift, I wrote more reports than I made arrests"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=law_sheriff,law_sergeant|tmp=veteran|st=careful",{"I wear a badge - do you want to see it?"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=law_trooper|tmp=veteran|st=friendly,neutral|world=road",{"State trooper - Highway patrol, I spent most of my life on the interstate"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=law_trooper|tmp=veteran|st=friendly,neutral|world=cars,road",{"Twelve years on the road with the state police, mostly pulling people out of cars"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=law_trooper|tmp=veteran|st=careful",{"Kentucky State Police - step back, please"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=law_corrections|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral|world=door",{"Corrections officer, Knox County lockup, twelve years behind a steel door"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=law_corrections|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"I worked the cell blocks, you learn a lot about people who've got nothing left to lose"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=law_corrections|tmp=seasoned|st=careful",{"Jail guard, that's my story - keep your hands where I can see them"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=swat_lead,swat_operator|tmp=veteran|st=friendly,neutral",{"County tactical team, training days, mostly - we were waiting for something that never happened until now"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=swat_lead,swat_operator|tmp=veteran|st=careful",{"Tactical - that's all"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=soldier,soldier_green|tmp=seasoned,fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Eight months in, I'd barely learned to make a bed correctly","Reserve, weekends only, I sold insurance on weekdays - I'm still sorting out which job was harder"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=soldier,soldier_green|tmp=seasoned,fresh|st=careful",{"Military, I can't discuss it"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=soldier_nco|tmp=veteran|st=friendly,neutral",{"Career Army - eighteen years, taught kids how to be soldiers - some of them even learned","Guard sergeant, weekends at the armory, weekdays at a feed mill - it prepared me better than you'd think"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=soldier_nco|tmp=veteran|st=careful",{"Infantry - ask something else"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=deserter,militia|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Used to wear a uniform, won't say whose, doesn't matter now","Hunter, mostly, the rest of the time I was angry at the government - I feel validated"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=deserter,militia|tmp=seasoned|st=careful",{"I took an oath once, I don't discuss it"}},
