{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=elite_operator,elite_delta,mercenary|tmp=veteran|st=careful",{"Not discussing it"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=outlaw|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral|world=vehicle",{"Odd jobs, hauled scrap, ran a tow truck, rolled a drunk or two - why? You hiring?"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=outlaw|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Never held a real job, doesn't mean I wasn't busy"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=outlaw|tmp=seasoned|st=careful",{"Mind your own damn business"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=raider,raider_boss|tmp=predator|st=friendly,neutral",{"Before? I took things from people who couldn't hold on to them - same line of work, bigger market","Pallet jack at the warehouse, it's how I learned to pick up whatever's lying around"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=raider,raider_boss|tmp=predator|st=careful",{"I took what I needed, same as now"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=gang_member,gang_boss|tmp=predator|st=friendly,neutral",{"Ran with my crew on the south side of Louisville - nothing's changed, same block, new rules","Worked the corner, sold things, bought things, kept an eye on things - business is business"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=gang_member,gang_boss|tmp=predator|st=careful",{"My business - not yours"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=biker,biker_boss|tmp=predator,veteran|st=friendly,neutral",{"Mechanic by trade, rode on weekends, mostly rode on weekdays, too","Welder, the club was my real job - the welding paid the gas"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=biker,biker_boss|tmp=predator,veteran|st=careful",{"Club business is club business"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=crime_member|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"I handled accounts, let's say I made sure certain people got paid","I ran errands for a man in Louisville, the kind where you don't ask what's in the box"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=crime_member|tmp=seasoned|st=careful",{"That's a rude question, friend"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=prisoner|tmp=predator|st=friendly,neutral",{"Got eight years for something I did, got out early - Ha - early"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=prisoner|tmp=predator|st=friendly,neutral|world=building",{"Kitchen duty at the state pen, best job I ever had, with the worst boss"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=prisoner|tmp=predator|st=careful",{"Don't ask me about that - ever"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=civilian_man,civilian_woman|st=friendly,neutral",{"I taught fifth grade -- FIFTH grade, eleven-year-olds, and this is what scares me?","Insurance adjuster, I looked at wrecked cars all day, heh, never thought I'd miss it","Bank teller, down on Main -- nine years counting other people's money, now I count cans","Bookkeeper for a feed supplier, nobody ever thanks the bookkeeper, you know that? nobody","Cashier at the grocery... twelve years of \"paper or plastic\" and \"have a blessed day\"..","I ran a hardware counter, knew where every last screw in the county went","Hair, I did hair... perms, mostly, ladies talk when you got their head in a sink, I know EVERYTHING about this town","Courthouse clerk, marriage licenses and deeds, boring as dirt, and God what I'd give for boring","I sold carpet, wall to wall -- who needs carpet now, right? ha, ha... yeah","Worked the line at a bottling plant, same bottle eight hours, forty thousand times","School bus, route fourteen, I knew every kid on it by name... I'm- sorry, next question","Dental hygienist, I'm the one who says \"you been flossing?\" and everybody lies, everybody","I tended bar at the VFW, heard every war story twice, I'd sit through 'em all again, swear to God","Substitute teacher, so the kids hated me AND didn't know my name","Nursing home aide, nights... no, I- I don't talk about that one, ask me anything else, please","Insurance salesman, whole life, term life, wow, what a joke that is now","Roofer, three summers, so I know how to fall off things and not die, handy as hell","Tobacco warehouse at auction time, all that chanting and spitting, I couldn't even explain it to you","I drove a delivery van, knew every back alley in four counties, comes in handy for ducking people now","Bookkeeper at a funeral home, yeah -- yeah, I KNOW, don't say it","Church secretary, bulletins and flower rotation and who's mad at who, that was a full-time job, believe me","Line cook, short order, I can still flip an egg in my sleep, nobody asked but I can","Stocked shelves, then assistant manager at the video rental, \"be kind, rewind\" was a real rule!","I worked a photo lab, developed people's vacations in an hour, all those smiling faces, I think about 'em","Used cars, I sold used cars, so when I tell you \"you can count on me\" it's a joke, okay? heh","Warehouse, forklift, home to the ballgame... God, I miss the ballgame","I was a librarian, and yes I'm gonna say shhh, I can't help it","Nursing school, second year, so I know a LITTLE, just enough to get somebody killed, sorry","Road crew for the county, thirty years of potholes and nobody ever said thanks","Radio station, overnights, played requests nobody called in -- isn't that something","College, junior year, accounting, spring break was gonna be Daytona, heh, Daytona","Phone company, repair, I untangled other people's lines for a living and I can't untangle this","Taxi dispatcher, all day long \"where are you?\" \"home\" \"okay, stay there\" -- I'd kill to say that again","I managed a bowling alley, league night every Thursday, God, I miss the noise","Pharmacy tech, counted pills by fives with a little plastic spatula, felt respectable","Florist, funerals mostly, weddings if we were lucky, never once got a sunny order","Mailroom at the paper, saw the news before it was news, didn't see THIS coming though, did I","Real estate, houses -- anybody want a fixer-upper? everything's a fixer-upper now","Pest control, raccoons mostly, so I've handled things that bite, doesn't help much","Cut hay for my uncle summers and sold insurance winters, a mixed-up life, but a life","Warehouse nights and a second job pumping gas, I was tired for about four years straight, now I'm tired differently","Part-time at a daycare, full-time sleep deprived, feels like I've been up since 1991","I did tax returns, every April for twenty years, never thought the thing I'd miss would be April","I fixed TVs and VCRs -- you ever try explaining to a man that his tape is fine and the problem is HIM"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=civilian_man,civilian_woman|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Don't laugh, I coached Little League, ten-year-olds, I'm not built for this","Uh, a student -- was? am? I don't know what you call it when school's a hole in the ground","I was supposed to start at the plant Monday... first day, had my lunch packed and everything!","Just graduated, like three weeks ago- they never even mailed the diploma! ha... ha","I- I was- ugh, accounting, I was in accounting, sounds so stupid out loud","Counter at the dry cleaners... pressed other people's good clothes, what do I even put on a resume now?","Nothing yet, I was nineteen, everybody kept asking what I'd be and now they can stop","Cashier, nights, for money to leave this stupid town, and now look, I'm still here, great","Wait, you mean like a real job? I had a summer job, I scooped ice cream, is that a real job?","I answered phones at my dad's office -- my whole career is \"please hold\"!"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=civilian_man,civilian_woman|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Schoolteacher, now I teach people not to walk around making noise, same job different class","Bookkeeper, I keep the tally for this crew, cans in, cans out, funny how it comes back to numbers","Mail carrier, I know every street and half the dogs, walk a lot, still do","Machinist, tool and die, eleven thousand hours at a lathe, steady hands help more than people think","Truck stop waitress, twenty-two years, I can read a man in four seconds, saves time","Claims adjuster, I spent my life telling folks their disaster wasn't covered, there's a joke in there somewhere","I was a nobody with a paycheck, now I'm a nobody with a pack, feels about the same","Same as everybody, a job I hated, and God help me I'd go back tomorrow"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=civilian_man,civilian_woman|st=careful",{"I had a job, HAD, ask me something else","Why do you wanna know? who's asking, exactly?","Doesn't matter anymore, nobody's paying me and nobody's checking","That's personal, sorry, I don't know you yet","Worked in town, leave it at that, I don't want to be easy to find!","Does it matter? you looking for work or looking for someone to rob?","Before, yeah... that's a long time ago, back off a little, would you","Nope, not telling, you tell me what YOU did first","I'm not answering questions from somebody I met two minutes ago, no offense"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=civilian_loner",{"Hunted whitetail mostly... taught me to sit still and shut up, both come in handy","I fished for a living, catfish, sold 'em off a tailgate Saturdays, it's gone real quiet since","Drifted, odd jobs, barn raising, tobacco cutting, a little welding, never kept my hat on one nail","Survivalist, if you gotta put a word on it -- neighbors laughed, nobody's laughing, gives me no pleasure","Ran a bait and tackle, worms, minnows, cold drinks, fellas talked about \"the big one\" all day long","Long-haul driver, hours on a highway can be lonelier than this, believe it or not","Trapper... muskrat, coon, a mink once, learned to move quiet and that turned out to be the whole trick...","I was a hermit with a mailing address, ha, you think I'm joking","Park service, seasonal, trail work and lost tourists, mostly I know the woods","Farrier... shoeing horses, gentle hands, loud mouth, now it's just the hands","Logging, chainsaws and bad knees, only trees I think about now are the ones that fall quiet","Stone quarry, dust and dynamite... quiet's nicer than dynamite, I'll say that","Seasonal, tobacco in summer, firewood in fall, nothing in winter, got real good at nothing","Fishing guide on the lake, bass tournaments, fellas paid me to point at where the fish wasn't","Moved scrap, pulled copper, you find what folks threw away, I'm good at looking where nobody looks","Boat mechanic at the marina, when the river went quiet so did the business","Plain old drifter, I fixed what needed fixing and moved on when the thanks got heavy","Gunsmith's apprentice two years, can clean and fix most anything that fires, that's all I'll say","Taxidermist -- don't make that face, it was a living and the deer never complained","Well driller, dug holes for a living, people always wanted water, they still do, don't they","Blacksmith weekends at the county fair, plumber weekdays, nobody knew till right now","Bakery deliveries, up at four every single day, you wouldn't believe how much I miss warm bread","Bounty of nothing, really, I picked up work where there was work -- fruit, hay, a funeral once"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=civilian_loner|st=careful",{"I worked alone, still do, next question","Not your business, not meaning to be rude, it's just habit","Odd jobs... which ones and where is none of your damn business","I'd rather hear what YOU did, friend","Hunted, trapped, kept to myself, that's all you get"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=family_man,family_woman,family_elder,family_youth|st=friendly,neutral",{"Farmer -- corn, soybeans, a little tobacco, third generation, we never took a vacation, not once","I ran the family orchard, apples, peaches, you think about picking season a lot when there's nothing to pick","Stay-at-home, four kids, if you wanna talk about managing an outbreak, I've done diaper season","Dairy, forty head, up at four every day for twenty-two years, I'd kill for a morning I could sleep in","Teacher's aide at the elementary, kids give you sticky hugs, I'd take a sticky hug right now, honest","Seamstress, hems and prom dresses and funeral suits, always had pins in my mouth, still do sometimes","I drove a school bus and helped at my brother's garage, pays nothing, keeps you honest","Cook for the church supper, bingo caller on Tuesdays, plenty to keep a body busy","We raised hogs, four hundred head, don't get me started, I'd rather talk about the smell of bacon","Second shift at the plant so I'd be home when the girls got off the bus... wouldn't trade that for anything","Dad's feed and seed, fifty-pound bags every morning till my back gave out, I thought THAT was hard","Daycare, twelve toddlers at once, honest to God, this isn't any louder than that was","Cut hair out of my kitchen, ladies Thursday, men Saturday, free for the preacher","Tax office at the courthouse, everybody hates the tax office, and now there's nobody at it!","Welder at a farm equipment shop, fixed combines mostly, anything with a bolt in it, really..","Raised tobacco and kids, tobacco was easier","I stayed home with my mother... which is a job nobody calls a job, believe me, it's a job","Waitress at the diner on 31, they knew my order, I knew theirs, and God I miss it"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=family_elder",{"Retired, forty-one years at the same plant, they gave me a watch, still running, everything else stopped","Farmed till my knees quit, then I let the boy have it, now he's... well, he had it","Taught Sunday school sixty years, never raised my voice, come to think, I could use a voice right about now","Postmaster... thirty-three years, sorted every letter in this county at least once..","Sold hardware thirty years, nails, paint, hinges, bait, folks came in for a thing and left with a story","Drove a milk truck, then a school bus... then I retired and the wife said get out from under my feet!","Deputy clerk at the courthouse, which makes me an expert on absolutely nothing","Worked the mines till they closed, then odd jobs, now odd jobs about the end of the world, ha","Railroad man, brakeman, watched this country go by at forty miles an hour for thirty years","Barber, forty-eight years in one chair, heard every opinion in this county, not one of 'em fixed anything","Nurse's aide, then deaconess, between the two I buried more people than I ever wanted to","Auto parts counter... name a part and I'd know the shelf, still do, and there's no shelf","Cannery in the summers, and a husband couldn't fix a thing, so I fixed things... that was my job, fixing","Seventy-one, what do you think I did, I worked until my hands quit asking permission"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=family_elder|st=careful",{"Retired, that's all you need to know, young one","I worked all my life, I'm NOT explaining it to a stranger","Used to be somebody, now I'm just old, move along, please","At my age my job is staying alive, you want to leave me to it?"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=family_youth",{"Student, senior year, supposed to be, cross-country team, I can still run, if that counts","Mowed lawns and delivered pizzas, nobody tipped -- no wait, everybody tipped, now I think about it","Just got my license, three weeks, Dad's truck's still in the yard, I never even drove it alone","Stocked shelves weekends... saving for a car -- now I don't need one, funny, huh","College freshman, dorm, pizza, all-nighters, I'd take a final exam right now, PLEASE, give me a final","I helped Dad on the farm, fed calves, hauled hay, it's the only reason I'm not helpless","Marching band, trombone, I know, I KNOW, it's useless, don't remind me","Lifeguard at the county pool, saved one kid from drowning, ha, now it's... yeah","Worked at the movie theater, tore tickets, swept popcorn, free movies though, best job ever","Paper route on a bicycle, knew every dog by name and temper","I did lawn work for neighbors, they paid in lemonade and five-dollar bills, I'd take lemonade right now","Nothing, I was seventeen, my \"job\" was being annoyed at my parents... God","Cleaned the bleachers after games, found a class ring once, still got it, never found who owned it"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=family_man,family_woman,family_elder,family_youth|st=careful",{"Don't ask me about before, it makes it hurt worse","We farmed, we kept to ourselves, that's all","That's family business, sorry","I did what folks do -- I'm not telling a stranger where I worked!!","Why? you gonna come looking?"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=worker",{"Mechanic -- brakes, belts, oil, every beat-up truck in this county's been under my hands once","Foreman at the plant, forty men answered to me, nobody answers to me now, I'm shocked how much I miss it","Lineman for the power company, climbed poles in storms, figured THAT was the worst job on earth","Drove for a freight outfit, four states, eleven hours a day, ever wonder where those trucks went?","Mailman... rain or shine, dogs mostly, dogs and the people who owned them","Ran a filling station, knew everybody's car by the sound of it, I wonder where all of 'em went","Pharmacy counter, folks told me things, lots of things, worse than this some days","Welder, pipe and structural, hands still know it, can't get the smell of a shop out of my nose","Plumber, clogged toilets, burst pipes, people thought I was gross until they needed me at three in the morning","Deckhand on a river barge, nine weeks on and two off, I miss that horn at night","Crane operator... lifted tons and never dropped one, never, proud of that...","Small-town postmaster... eight boxes and a flag, I know everybody's business and kept every bit of it","Carpenter, framing mostly, I built half the porches on Church Street, they're holding up better than the people","Electrician, I know what's behind a wall by the sound it makes, useful and sad, in this business","Body shop, dents and scratches and paint, fix a bumper and folks think you fixed their whole life","Shipping and receiving, I know where the pallets are, I know where everything is SUPPOSED to be","Bulldozers, clearing land, leveling lots, funny how that's what saved my hide","Short-order cook and dishwasher, I'm the guy who knows how to make four hundred of anything","County clerk's office, deeds, permits -- got a question about a fence line? I'm your man","Small engines, mowers, chainsaws, outboards, funny thing, nobody brings 'em in anymore","Managed a farm supply, seeds, fertilizer, feed, if you ever wanna plant something, ask me","Tire man, flats and alignments, honest work, I can mount a tire in ninety seconds flat","Sawmill, lost two fingers, don't worry, I count 'em every morning","Trucker, hauled coal and gravel, got real good at not sleeping... comes in handy now, uh","Supervisor on the loading dock, three years short of my pension, three YEARS, can you believe that"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=worker|st=careful",{"I worked -- hard, for somebody else, that's all you get","Doesn't matter NOW, let's keep it that way","Why? so you can pick me out of a lineup? move on","Odds and ends, mostly, nothing you'd want to hire me for"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=rescue_medical",{"Nurse... twelve-hour shifts, second floor, I've held more hands than you'd ever guess...","EMT, county ambulance, nights, I saw this county at its worst... and then this happened","Pharmacist... counted, labeled, double-checked, Lord, the double-checking, I'd double-check this whole world if I could","Family doctor, forty years, I delivered half the babies on this block, I'm trying not to think about it","Vet, large animals, cattle and horses, I've pulled a calf at three in the morning, this is... similar","Paramedic, rescue squad -- I know what it sounds like when people stop breathing, and I'm so tired of that sound","Dental assistant, believe it or not... never figured stitching would come in handy","Nurse practitioner at a rural clinic, toddlers to great-grandmas, never turned anyone away, not once","ER tech, triage mostly, I'm good at deciding who's worst off, and I HATE that I'm good at it","Home health aide, I visited old folks in their own houses, most of them are... gone, now","Respiratory therapist, ventilators, sounds fancy, it was mostly patience and coffee..","Hospice nurse, I sat with the dying for twelve years, don't think I'm afraid of death -- I'm afraid of THIS","Surgical tech, I handed the surgeon instruments and kept my mouth shut, good habit...","Medical secretary, insurance forms and appointment cards, sounds stupid now, doesn't it","Lab tech, blood work, I know what a normal count looks like, and I know what this isn't"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=rescue_medical|st=careful",{"I was in medicine, I'd rather NOT say where, folks come looking for you","Not telling, it would only make you ask me for things","Healthcare, and no, I can't look at your arm right now!","Let's say I worked with sick people, and leave it there"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=rescue_clergy",{"Pastor, little Baptist church, ninety on a good Sunday, ninety, I could recite their names in the dark","Deacon, passed the plate, mowed the lawn, drove the bus to youth camp, whatever needed doing","Seminary student, final year, hadn't even been ordained, I'm kinda making it up as I go","Chaplain at the county jail, heard confessions you wouldn't believe, never thought I'd be on the locked side","Priest, small parish, bingo Tuesdays and confession Saturdays, people confess the funniest things","Church organist, forty years of hymns, my fingers still move on my knees at night, can't help it","Sunday school teacher and church secretary, I know every child's name in the congregation, every one","Missionary, two years in Honduras, back a year, funny, I had more fear THERE than I do now","Youth minister, taught teenagers to sing and play volleyball, nothing prepared me for this","Deaconess, baked casseroles for every funeral in this county, which, uh, is a lot of casseroles right now","Hospital chaplain... sat with families in waiting rooms, I never knew those rooms would fill up like this","Pastor's wife, which is its own kind of job, casseroles, committees, quiet"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=rescue_clergy|st=careful",{"I served, I won't say more than that","A church job, don't ask which church, please","Folks come looking for a preacher when they're scared -- I'd rather not be found","I prayed for a living, and I can't tell you right now whether it worked"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=rescue_firefighter",{"Firefighter, volunteer company, fourteen years, I've pulled people out of worse -- maybe, I think","Fire captain, county district, drills every Thursday, never trained for this, I'll tell you that","Engine driver, pump operator, I know how to keep water moving, which sounds stupid now","Paramedic on a fire engine, smoke, wrecks, heart attacks, trained for everything but this","Fire inspector... smoke detectors and exit signs, nobody liked me, now I'd give anything for a smoke detector","Rescue squad volunteer, hauled folks out of ditches and sinkholes, cave rescue even","Dispatcher for the fire district, heard every bad call come in, and then they stopped coming","Ladder company... roof work, window work, heights don't scare me, other things do","Hazmat, seven years, if anyone ought to know how to wear a mask it's me, and nobody asked","Fire marshal's office, arson cases, I can tell you who did what by how a room burned","Volunteer, my day job was lineman, weekends I answered the pager, tired like you wouldn't believe","Probationary firefighter, four months in, FOUR MONTHS, I barely got my boots broken in"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=rescue_firefighter|st=careful",{"Fire service, that's it, I'm not giving a name","It was a job, saving people, hasn't paid in a while, ask something else","Firefighter -- and you can quit looking at my gear"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=militia",{"Reserve unit, weekends, electrician weekdays, never thought I'd really get called up","Hunter's ed instructor and rifle club, I know my way around a firearm, probably better than a stranger should","Hardware store owner, local militia on weekends, don't laugh, we kept this block safe","Roofer by trade, shooting club on Tuesdays, turns out Tuesdays were practice","I farmed, deer season, coon season, groundhog season, everything I shoot I eat","Sheriff's posse volunteer... parades and lost-kid searches, that was the extent of it till now","Security guard at a plant, flashlight and a thermos, took it serious, maybe too serious","National Guard, three years, then out -- enough to know how to stand a post, not enough to like it","Gun shop clerk, I know ammunition like other folks know recipes, not a skill to brag about","Machinist, hobby shooter, loaded my own rounds at the kitchen table","Truck driver, concealed-carry class every year, folks said I was paranoid, hm, funny that"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=militia|st=careful",{"Used to have a job, now I got a post... and I'm keeping it!!","Keeping watch, that's my job NOW, you'll have to be satisfied with that","Why? you writing a report? move along"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|mood=fear",{"I- I was a, a clerk, a normal clerk, it's silly, I know, I'm useless now","Nothing important, nothing useful, I fixed spreadsheets, can you believe it, spreadsheets!","I worked at the grocery -- I stocked cans, so, I know where the cans are, if that helps!!","Why do you ask? is it a test? did I fail?"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral|mood=grim",{"It doesn't matter what I did, it matters what I do now","Worked a desk for twenty years, and my back still hates me for it","Same old job... different boss, the boss is hunger now..."}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=sad",{"I was a teacher, and I... I lost my whole class... I can't...","A mother, a wife, a baker, I made bread every morning, and nobody's eaten it in days","I drove a school bus, and I still hear them, singing in the back"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=angry",{"I worked my fingers to the bone for that damn company, and for what? for what?!","I was a mechanic, I fixed other people's cars, and not one of them came back for me"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly|mood=warm",{"I was a baker, I'd love to bake you a loaf, someday, when the ovens warm up","A nurse, a hugger, a listener, I'm still all three, you can tell me anything"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=funny",{"I was a professional napper, I mean, an accountant, same thing, ha","Dog groomer, believe it or not... biters were my whole job, ha","I sold used cars","I was an accountant, ha","I was a clown at birthday parties"},false,false,{[3]={{t="which means I'm very good at lying",afterMs=3000},{t="and very bad at admitting it",afterMs=2800}},[4]={{t="so I can tell you exactly how doomed we are, down to the penny",afterMs=3200}},[5]={{t="it's a long story, ha",afterMs=3500},{t="the dead are tougher audiences",afterMs=3000}}}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful|mood=fear",{"I don't talk about my job!","W-who wants to know?"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|fact=recent_zombie_contact",{"Doesn't matter, doesn't matter, nothing in my old job prepared me for THIS","I'll tell you when we're safe","Later... later -- they're loud","I was somebody normal... and now I'm running!"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|fact=player_armed",{"Not a soldier, not like you, I'm just a regular person"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"I drove a delivery truck, bread mostly","I worked the register at a hardware store","I was a hairdresser","Insurance claims -- believe it or not","I worked at the post office","I was a teacher","I cleaned offices at night","I was a mechanic, and a good one","I tended bar","I was a nurse's aide...","I did taxes","I was a farmer","I managed a grocery","I was a cook at a diner","I drove a school bus","I did odd jobs","I worked at the bank","I was a janitor"},false,false,{[1]={{t="the smell, the early mornings",afterMs=3500},{t="God, I miss the smell",afterMs=3000}},[2]={{t="you'd be amazed how many people can't find a screw",afterMs=3200}},[3]={{t="I knew everyone's secrets, and kept every one of them",afterMs=3500}},[4]={{t="I spent my days saying \"no, that isn't covered\"",afterMs=3200},{t="and now nothing is",afterMs=2800}},[5]={{t="sorting other people's mail",afterMs=3500},{t="I still check my own pockets for letters",afterMs=3000}},[6]={{t="fourth grade",afterMs=3500},{t="they'd be in the summer program now... running around, being loud",afterMs=3000}},[7]={{t="nobody ever sees you, nobody ever thanks you",afterMs=3200},{t="I liked it",afterMs=2800}},[8]={{t="funny how a skill can feel useless and useful at once",afterMs=3500}},[9]={{t="I heard every sad story in the county",afterMs=3200},{t="I could write a book, if I had paper",afterMs=3000}},[10]={{t="changing sheets, helping folks up",afterMs=3500},{t="it was the best job I ever had",afterMs=3000}},[11]={{t="I know, I know, I'm sorry",afterMs=3200},{t="nobody likes a tax man",afterMs=2800}},[12]={{t="my father's farm, my grandfather's",afterMs=3500},{t="I think about the soil more than the people, now",afterMs=3000}},[13]={{t="I knew where every can was",afterMs=3200},{t="and every can's price",afterMs=3000}},[14]={{t="hash browns, eggs, coffee",afterMs=3500},{t="people said I made the best gravy in the county",afterMs=3000}},[15]={{t="the kids called me \"Mister Billy\"",afterMs=3200},{t="I wonder where they are",afterMs=2800}},[16]={{t="fix this, paint that, haul the other",afterMs=3500},{t="the odd jobs haven't stopped",afterMs=3000}},[17]={{t="counted other people's money",afterMs=3200},{t="now I count my own cans",afterMs=2800}},[18]={{t="at the high school",afterMs=3500},{t="I knew all the kids' names",afterMs=3000},{t="I still do",afterMs=2800}}}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"I'd rather hear about your life before"},false,false,{[1]={{t="what did you do?",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"What I did ain't your business","Why does it matter?","Doesn't matter!","That's personal","I had a job","Why?","Ask someone else"},false,false,{[3]={{t="it's over",afterMs=3000}},[5]={{t="that's all I'm going to say",afterMs=3000}},[6]={{t="are you hiring? are you hunting?",afterMs=2800}}}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Nothing that's your business, and nothing I'd put on a form","I took things for a living, nothing's changed","Odd jobs, mostly, with a lot of free time and a short temper","Worked in a warehouse, got laid off, you see where that led","Truck driver, until I lost my license and then my patience"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=raider|st=hostile",{"My job was making people like you regret asking"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=raider|st=friendly",{"Honestly? Cooked at a diner, you believe that? I miss it","Worked construction, hard days, but I was good at it"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=raider_boss,gang_boss,biker_boss|st=neutral,careful",{"I ran a crew then too, just a different kind"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"This and that, nothing you'd write down","Hustling, like everybody around here","Washing dishes at a joint on Broadway, till I got tired of it"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=gang|st=hostile",{"My job was staying alive, and I'm still doing it"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=gang|st=friendly",{"Worked at a car wash, saved up for a stereo, then all this happened"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"Mechanic, been fixing engines since I was twelve","Welder at the plant, until they cut my hours","Roofer, bad knees, worse luck"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=club|st=hostile",{"Whatever it was, it's irrelevant now"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=club|st=friendly",{"Hauled freight, I miss the open road"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"Consulting, if you'd like to call it that","Import and export, mainly","Let's say I helped people with their problems"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=crime|st=friendly",{"Accountant, believe it or not... I'm real good with numbers"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"Before the cell, I-- I drove a delivery truck, I had a wife","They gave me a job in the laundry inside, that's all I know","Can't talk about it... don't wanna remember it either"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=prison|st=hostile",{"What's it matter?! I'm here now!"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=prison|st=friendly",{"Worked the line at a plant in Frankfort, I was happy, I think"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful",{"Hunting guide, then not much of anything","Farmhand, I know my way around the woods","Loggers, my family, I'm good with an axe"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=outlaw|st=friendly",{"Taught high school shop, can you imagine me teaching teenagers?"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=deserter|st=neutral,careful",{"Army, two years, that's it"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"Deputy for eleven years, nothing else","Patrolman for the city, before they merged us","Worked the road for the state, every shift a lot of accidents"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=law|st=hostile",{"That's not your concern, {g:pal|lady}"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=law|st=friendly",{"Always wanted to be a cop, got to do it, I was lucky"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=law_sheriff|st=neutral,careful",{"Sheriff for twelve years, and a farmer before that"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=law_trooper|st=neutral,careful",{"State police, nineteen years, I retire next spring, or I would have"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=law_sergeant|st=neutral,careful",{"Twenty years on the force, mostly nights"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=law_corrections|st=neutral,careful",{"Ten years at the state prison, I've seen every kind of man"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=military|st=neutral,careful",{"Joined at eighteen, haven't done anything else"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=military|st=hostile",{"That's classified, move along"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=military|st=friendly",{"Motor pool mechanic... yeah, I know, shocking"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=soldier_nco|st=neutral,careful",{"Career Army, fifteen years, I know what I'm doing"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=soldier_green|st=neutral,careful",{"Um, I was in school, then I enlisted, I never expected this"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=elite|st=neutral,careful",{"Not something I discuss, you can stop asking now"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=militia|st=neutral,careful",{"Farmer, same as my dad, and his dad","Worked at the feed store, now I guard it","Carpenter, I'd build you a house in a week, if the world was normal"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=militia|st=hostile",{"That's not important, what's yours?"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=militia|st=friendly",{"Taught Sunday school, if you can believe it"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|sex=m",{"I sold insurance, flood, fire, theft - there's nothing in the policy about this - I checked"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|sex=f",{"I did hair at a salon in Rosewood, had a perm booked for two o'clock Saturday, she never came in"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Assistant manager at the video store, everybody in this town still owes me late fees"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=family_man|st=friendly,neutral",{"Drove a milk route for the dairy, four in the morning, thirty-one stops, my body still wakes me at four"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=family_woman|st=friendly,neutral",{"Taught second grade, I still count heads every time we move, can't help it"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=family_youth|st=friendly,neutral",{"Mowed lawns, detasseled corn in the summer, stuff that doesn't count for much now"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=family_elder|st=friendly,neutral",{"Farmed, tobacco and some beef cattle - I'd wager I'm the only one here who's done hard work before this"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=civilian,family|tmp=seasoned,veteran|st=friendly,neutral",{"Accountant, not much call for balancing books when the bank's full of dead folks"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=seasoned,veteran|st=friendly,neutral|world=vehicle,road",{"Drove a school bus, I know every back road from here to Irvington - finally good for something"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=seasoned,veteran|st=friendly",{"Carpenter, you've got the hands of somebody who's swung a hammer - we could use that - want to join up?"},false,{[1]="JOIN_GROUP"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=militia,civilian_loner|st=friendly,neutral",{"Hunting guide - deer, mostly, these things are dumber than deer, but they don't spook"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=worker|st=friendly,neutral",{"Barrel house at a distillery, one county over, twenty-six years of smelling bourbon and never drinking on the clock"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=worker|st=friendly,neutral|world=door",{"Welder, still a welder, I just weld doors shut now, instead of opening things up"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=rescue_firefighter|st=friendly,neutral",{"Same job, only difference is nobody pays us and the people we pull out try to bite"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=rescue_medical|st=friendly,neutral",{"Paramedic, eleven years, I've seen a lot of bad nights - nothing like Friday"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=rescue_clergy|st=friendly,neutral",{"Pastor of a little Baptist church in Ekron - eighty members, I've done eleven funerals since Sunday"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=careful",{"I don't, why? Why does that matter? I wasn't anybody, okay?"},false,{[1]="GENERIC"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned,veteran|st=careful",{"Doesn't matter what I did, what matters is what I'll do if you come closer"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=hostile",{"I minded my own business, full time, you ought to try it"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=law_deputy,law_sheriff|st=friendly,neutral|world=road",{"Same thing - deputy sheriff, just used to be traffic stops and cattle out on the road"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=law_officer,law_sergeant|st=friendly,neutral",{"Patrolman, seven years, I'd give anything for a noise complaint about a barking dog again"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=law_corrections|st=friendly,neutral",{"Guarded the county work farm, taught the GED class on Tuesdays - couple of those boys were close to passing"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=law_trooper|st=friendly,neutral",{"Wrote speeding tickets on the interstate, sixty-seven in a fifty-five - seems like a cute problem now"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=law,swat|st=careful",{"Law enforcement, then and now, that's all the small talk I've got"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=law,swat|st=hostile",{"My job, then and now, is putting people like you on the ground"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=swat|st=friendly,neutral",{"Same job"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=military|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Army, signed up after high school, supposed to be college money"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=military|tmp=veteran|st=friendly,neutral",{"Soldier - nineteen years, did Panama, did the Gulf - never had to do my own country before"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=military|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral,careful",{"I worked the fryer at a burger place outside Scranton - four months ago, feels like somebody else's life"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=military|st=careful,hostile",{"What I did before doesn't matter, you're approaching a military position"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=elite|st=friendly,neutral",{"Same thing, somewhere else"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=elite|st=careful,hostile",{"No"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=outlaw|st=friendly,neutral",{"Little of this, little of that - mostly that - don't ask about the that"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=deserter|st=friendly,neutral|world=cars",{"Army motor pool, I fixed trucks - then I stole one"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=outlaw|st=careful,hostile|world=cars",{"Stuff that got me put in the back of cars - leave it at that"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=raider|st=friendly,neutral",{"Roofing, off and on - mostly off, this pays better"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","role=raider_boss|st=friendly,neutral",{"Ran a salvage yard, same business now, just more inventory"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=gang|st=friendly,neutral|world=road",{"Street pharmacist - heh - still am, business is booming"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=club|st=friendly,neutral",{"Tattoos, repos, and the occasional favor, same as now"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=prison|st=friendly,neutral",{"Laundry detail, C-Block, fourteen cents an hour, so I guess I'm on strike now"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=raider,gang,club,prison|st=careful",{"What I did before is what I'm fixing to do again if you don't move"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=raider,gang,club,prison|st=hostile",{"Before? I did this, just had to be sneakier about it"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=crime|st=friendly,neutral",{"Imports and exports, mostly I made sure people paid what they owed"}},
{"ASK_JOB_BEFORE","reg=crime|st=careful,hostile",{"My old job involved people who asked too many questions - I still remember how it's done"}},
}
